WEBVTT

00:17:00.401 --> 00:17:02.161
kerana langkahan itu
atas impianku."

00:17:02.857 --> 00:17:05.641
Dan setiap hari, di mana-mana,

00:17:05.665 --> 00:17:08.854
anak-anak kita membentang
impian mereka di bawah kaki kita.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.024
Dan kita harus
berhati-hati.

00:17:12.189 --> 00:17:13.262
Terima kasih.

00:17:13.286 --> 00:17:16.920
(Tepukan)

00:17:16.944 --> 00:17:18.323
Terima kasih banyak..

00:17:18.347 --> 00:17:22.365
(Tepukan)

00:17:22.389 --> 00:17:23.404
Terima kasih.

00:17:23.428 --> 00:17:26.428
(Tepukan)